Package: deepin-doctor-daemon
Source: deepin-doctor
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: YinJie <yinjie@example.com>
Installed-Size: 242
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1 (>= 3.0), libqt5core5a (>= 5.15.1), libqt5dbus5 (>= 5.0.2), libstdc++6 (>= 5)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Deepin System Diagnostic Tool - Backend Daemon
 deepin-doctor-daemon is the backend service for the deepin-doctor
 system diagnostic tool. It runs with system privileges to perform
 diagnostics and apply fixes.
 .
 This package provides the system daemon that handles privileged
 operations via D-Bus interface.
